# Historical defect 2, reproduced: the first fix for the same-day tie broke
# it on `fact-id !=` alone, which silences the branch for two identical
# readings from two feeds.

rule fixture.latest-low-factid v0.1
says "The holder's most recent alpha reading in the last 180 days is below 70."

subject holder

collection readings : reading for subject via holder

conclude LatestLow when
  some reading r in readings
  require r.test-code = alpha
  require r.amount < 70
  require r.taken-day >= as-of-day - 180
  require r.taken-day <= as-of-day
  none of
    some reading n in readings
    require n.test-code = alpha
    require n.fact-id != r.fact-id
    require n.taken-day >= r.taken-day
    require n.taken-day <= as-of-day
